{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.11","index":11,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.11.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"素","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"隐","pinyin":"yǐn","traditional":"隱","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"guài","traditional":"怪","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shù","traditional":"述","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fú","traditional":"弗","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Menuntut ilmu gaib dan melakukan perbuatan mujijad agar termasyhur pada jaman mendatang, Aku takkan melakukannya. (S.S. VII:21; XI: 12)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.11.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zūn","traditional":"遵","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bàn","traditional":"半","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tú","traditional":"途","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"废","pinyin":"fèi","traditional":"廢","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fú","traditional":"弗","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"已","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Seorang Junzi - Kuncu yang bertekad hidup di dalam Jalan Suci, tetapi setengah jalan membatalkan tekadnya; bagiku tidak dapat tidak melanjutkannya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.11.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"依","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yōng","traditional":"庸","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"遁","pinyin":"dùn","traditional":"遯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huǐ","traditional":"悔","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"唯","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"圣","pinyin":"shèng","traditional":"聖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Seorang Junzi - Kuncu yang dapat terus di dalam Tengah Sempurna, sekalipun tidak dikenal dunia, ia tidak menyesal; hanya seorang Nabi mampu berbuat demikian.\" (Bc. IV B: 10). TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XI (Luasnya Jalan Suci)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/11 - Bab X - Yang Wajar dan Tekun.md","title":"Bab X — Yang Wajar dan Tekun"}
